 {
  "id": "q_phy005",
  "type": "NVQ",
  "stem": "A $6\\ \\Omega$ and a $3\\ \\Omega$ resistor are connected in parallel, and this combination is connected in series with a $2\\ \\Omega$ resistor across an ideal $8$ V battery. The current drawn from the battery, in amperes, is",
