   "value": 2,
   "tol": 0
  },
  "solution": "Parallel part: $\\dfrac{6\\times3}{6+3}=2\\ \\Omega$. Total resistance $=2+2=4\\ \\Omega$.\n\n$I=V/R=8/4=2$ A.",
